%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 413d64d7f6ce4c54c942e901f83eb9b4, type: 3}
  m_Name: Truck Idol
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTextSO
  SpeakerType: 0
  defaultPlayerImage: {fileID: 3516079381801495997, guid: b0206ccead3847d49911a68f16ebc122, type: 3}
  defaultNPCImage: {fileID: 0}
  hasCutscene: 0
  Steps:
  - SpeakerType: 2
    Name: Narrator
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: 0}
    Text: You look upon a stone statue that seems out of place for a medieval city
      like this. You're pretty sure trucks didn't exist didn't exits during these
      times. Not like you ever listened during history class though.
    sfx: 0
    pitch: 0
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 0
  - SpeakerType: 2
    Name: Narrator
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: 0}
    Text: But you know exactly why this is here.
    sfx: 0
    pitch: 0
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 0
  - SpeakerType: 0
    Name: Player
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: 3516079381801495997, guid: b0206ccead3847d49911a68f16ebc122, type: 3}
    Text: Pretty sure the truck I got hit by was way bigger than that. Like a transport
      truck or something, not a pick-up.
    sfx: 14
    pitch: 0.8
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 0
  - SpeakerType: 0
    Name: Player
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: 3516079381801495997, guid: b0206ccead3847d49911a68f16ebc122, type: 3}
    Text: What the heck are these guys even doing, worshipping a damn truck...
    sfx: 14
    pitch: 0.8
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 0
  - SpeakerType: 2
    Name: Narrator
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: 0}
    Text: You look closer at some words on the base of the statue,
    sfx: 0
    pitch: 0.8
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 0
  - SpeakerType: 2
    Name: Narrator
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: 0}
    Text: '"To the almighty one, the God of our city: Evuul-Kult. May its wheels
      be blessed and ever turning, its engine never stalling and its fumes choking
      our enemies. All glory and power to the Truck of Trucks!"'
    sfx: 0
    pitch: 0.8
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 0
  - SpeakerType: 0
    Name: Player
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: 1639174027949059371, guid: 89a0eb1b45e47c740aa21bd41d73cb21, type: 3}
    Text: .....
    sfx: 14
    pitch: 0.8
    autoskip: 1
    screenshake: 0
  - SpeakerType: 0
    Name: Player
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: 1639174027949059371, guid: 89a0eb1b45e47c740aa21bd41d73cb21, type: 3}
    Text: Psychos.
    sfx: 14
    pitch: 0.8
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 0
  - SpeakerType: 2
    Name: Knights
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: 0}
    Text: Hey! You dare speak against our God?
    sfx: 14
    pitch: 0.7
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 1
  - SpeakerType: 2
    Name: Wolf Knight
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: -8171068775573993944, guid: 7b2f1f6ada005db478230a1c006c332c, type: 3}
    Text: Who even are you? And what are you doing here in Evuul-Kult?
    sfx: 14
    pitch: 0.7
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 0
  - SpeakerType: 0
    Name: Player
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: 1639174027949059371, guid: 89a0eb1b45e47c740aa21bd41d73cb21, type: 3}
    Text: I was just looking for Maniac Street down to Idiot Creek! But I guess I've
      already found it!
    sfx: 14
    pitch: 0.8
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 0
  - SpeakerType: 0
    Name: Elric
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: 3049418459031337693, guid: 871d73153e1ff9940a05e24c910efabc, type: 3}
    Text: Actually that's a real place in this city.
    sfx: 14
    pitch: 0.8
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 0
  - SpeakerType: 2
    Name: Wolf Knight
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: -8171068775573993944, guid: 7b2f1f6ada005db478230a1c006c332c, type: 3}
    Text: You mean Manaiek Street, that's just a left turn. And Edeeh-Uht Creek is
      the opposite direction, buddy. You're not from here are you?
    sfx: 14
    pitch: 0.7
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 0
  - SpeakerType: 0
    Name: Player
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: 1639174027949059371, guid: 89a0eb1b45e47c740aa21bd41d73cb21, type: 3}
    Text: Why is everyone in this city all lunatics and morons! Including your stupid
      truck-kun!
    sfx: 14
    pitch: 0.8
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 1
  - SpeakerType: 2
    Name: Knights
    SpeakerImage: {fileID: 0}
    Text: Its power is far beyond your imagination! Who are you to speak against
      our God, and against us, its noble servants?
    sfx: 14
    pitch: 0.7
    autoskip: 0
    screenshake: 0
